<title>USA: Checkfree names James Douglass CFO.</title>
<headline>Checkfree names James Douglass CFO.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>CheckFree Corp said on Monday that it named James Douglass as chief financial officer, effective September 23.</p>
<p>He replaces Robert Bower who left the company to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Douglass currently serves as vice president, corporate controller for Medaphis Corp. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
